      "content": "## Document overview\n\n<figure>\n\nBEHAVIOR ANALYST\n\nBACB\n®\nCERTIFICATION BOARD\n®\n\n</figure>\n\nUS Employment Demand\nfor Behavior Analysts:\n\n2010-2025\n\n<figure>\n\nLightcast\n\n</figure>\n\nCopyright @ 2026 Behavior Analyst Certification Board®, BACB®. All rights reserved.\nBoard Certified Behavior Analyst®, BCBA®, Board Certified Behavior Analyst-Doctoral®, BCBA-D®, Board Certified Assistant\nBehavior Analyst®, and BCaBAR are owned by the Behavior Analyst Certification Board.\n\nElectronic and/or paper copies of part or all of this work may be made for personal, educational, or policymaking purposes,\nprovided such copies are not made or distributed for profit or commercial advantage. All copies, regardless of medium,\nmust include this notice on the first page. Abstracting with proper credit is permitted.\n\nThis document should be referenced as:\nBehavior Analyst Certification Board. (2026). US employment demand for behavior analysts: 2010-2025.\nhttps://www.bacb.com/wp-content/us_employmentdemand_ba/\n\n<!-- PageBreak -->\n\n<!-- PageHeader=\"US EMPLOYMENT DEMAND FOR BEHAVIOR ANALYSTS\" -->\n<!-- PageHeader=\"2010-2025\" -->",
